      <p class="gp-cta-sub reveal-up delay-1">Dates, group size, which courses you want. Mike builds a full stay-and-play package — tee times at all 5 courses, lodging, day-by-day itinerary — and sends it back within 24 hours. Free, no commitment.</p>
      <div class="reveal-scale delay-2">
        <a href={QUOTE_URL} class="btn-green-glow gp-btn">Get a Custom Package Quote →</a>
        <p style="margin-top:14px"><a href="/trips/" style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.35);text-decoration:none;">Browse real completed packages + pricing →</a></p>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.28);margin-top:14px">2–200+ golfers · All 5 courses · 24hr quote · 4.8★</p>
